    Bug 1975860 - Account Hub: Logic for showing credentials confirmation for 3rd party hosted account. r=freaktechnik


    **How to Test**
    - Use the Apps4Rent testing account available to us
    - This account is flaky, so sometimes it will show the confirmation step right away because the server hasn't returned an authentication error
    - And sometimes it will show the confirmation step after showing the password step, with no previous confirmation step shown
    - You should be able to confirm submitting credentials and see a configuration step afterwards (whether manual, or config found)

    ***
    3rd party Logic test updates

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D265893

